+### [Mandelbulb Isosurface Extraction via Marching Cubes](8166-mandelbulb-isosurface-extraction-via-marching-cubes.md)
+A technique to generate a 3D mesh of the Mandelbulb fractal by computing a scalar field function on a 3D grid and extracting the isosurface using the marching cubes algorithm [8166-mandelbulb-isosurface-extraction-via-marching-cubes.md]. It is chosen when a smooth, renderable mesh is required instead of raw voxel data.
+
 ### Knot Fractal Generation
 A fractal distance function representing a knot shape, constructed by iterating and transforming a base curve [S2, unofficial]. It differs from Bristorbrot by operating on a 2D cross-section $(r, \text{ang})$ extended into 3D, rather than a direct 3D polynomial map [S2, unofficial]. It is chosen when a knotted topology is desired rather than a bulbous fractal structure [S2, unofficial].
